            "review_title": "Review at Thai Siam Kitchen",
            "review_text": "NorthStar36373528173\n1 contribution\n0\nThe dark experiment.\nApr 2026 • Family\nI had a disappointing experience at the restaurant. The seating space is not guaranteed, the seating place is very unpleasant, directly affecting the meal.\n\nThe food is really unhappy. The food is too sweet, losing its natural taste. I made it clear not to eat peanut but when bringing the dish again has a spicy taste, this is quite inconvenient because it can not be eaten.\n\nIn particular, the baked pork is served in a live state of meat, which not only loses taste but also causes concerns about food hygiene and safety.\n\nHopefully the restaurant can review the quality of service and processing to improve, as the experience this time is really not good.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nTranslated from Vietnamese\nShow original\nWritten April 10, 2026",
